mail_new = "Who would win? A hedgehog or a hot dog. This is the question no one has answered ever. But that's changing today! I'm gonna put them both in the race of all time and test who prevails. This is my proposal for my next project. I request one hedgehog and one hot dog. Since I'll need them soon for funding presentation, please make sure that you got them right."
