mail_reward = "My proposal actually went through. They gave a green light! Now let the race between a hedgehog and a hot dog commence! Thanks a bunch, new intern."
mail_complaint = "This is an important matter you know. You blew it! Now the world will never know which one would win in a race. Also I didn't get the funding... It's all your fault, newbie."
